      "id": "hellmark-yblock",
      "title": "Hellmark's guide to Ford's Y-Block",
      "description": "Practical speed manual for oiling, rocker geometry, and tuning Ford's deep-skirt 292 Y-block V8.",
      "content": "Ford's 292 Y-block carries a rigid deep-skirt crankcase that handles hard launches when the top end is set up right. Flush the rocker-shaft oil passages thoroughly, set mechanical lash cold and re-check hot, and seal the valley cover snugly before bolting down the intake.\n\nBecause the Y-block's stacked intake ports turn sharply into the heads, careful gasket alignment and balanced carburetor linkage free up crisp midrange pull and steady top-end power.",
      "family": "ford-yblock",
      "parameter-name": "hp",
      "value": "4"
